  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f639fdbe7d45ab55dc0ee6d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她是来自国外的留学生，\n那沉静的模样在出道战也相当突出。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9f28634ea05026dab0e1f6a81e35032ecfd83b7d74f1b2d4814b8090b6223dc3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1084/storytimeline_501084114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        12,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/12/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:46202df0d398cca2dd96f5f4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "当然，如果只是个冷静的赛马娘，\n那么要找到一样的赛马娘应该不难。\n只是吉兆──",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a8cb469e7a6234bfa4446ae92aa0e999c1773aa70d286460ea6872f2b5dc21f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1084/storytimeline_501084114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        13,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/13/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ccdab157845de87b5e6eaa7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她在出道战之后的采访中如此断言，\n“我来到日本是为了替日本的\n竞赛界带来‘革命’”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2dcb6b9fd005d5d4461a09637bf1990f6c42221479fbaea80a30ca46834b2850",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1084/storytimeline_501084114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        14,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/14/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a2a939fded46ffb39c63a5c9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就连说出这么宏大的目标时，\n她都没有表现出一丝恐惧或紧张，\n看起来无比从容……",
      "source_fingerprint": "a5b132d1cdd610a540027946c6e80e6bbc8abb4a46b0b11d71f6dbf8ad5049ba",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1084/storytimeline_501084114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        15,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/15/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:27992529719287f4299d9132",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那决心“坚定”的模样……\n让我觉得那足以匹敌\n谷野美酒拥有的意志──",
      "source_fingerprint": "fafa91c029ff797e24cf54670b217db51e240fd95f1fc6c922146341a6e30f6a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1084/storytimeline_501084114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        16,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/16/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:35249c8e7666e78c4cdc5453",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而现在吉兆一步一步地\n将自己的跑法磨练得更加锐利，\n这样的话，接下来──",
      "source_fingerprint": "3cbf361d42141050f7578735dbdd1fef3bbaa42888f6e00f488f09e8bd801cdd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1084/storytimeline_501084114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        17,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/17/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:96f2ed0d2d92aae4deb2e049",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "谷野美酒",
      "source_fingerprint": "313e63f64ae1904fcf07bab0ada331d13e164e5dd9cfb8cdad386ace12e23d08",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1084/storytimeline_501084114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        18,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/18/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:56b3ce4db847ca16b5d930a5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "──没错，最该当心的就是她。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4801006679c153aaea6ed6fa2afddbb7da455360e1b53af8fc924711d8fc48de",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1084/storytimeline_501084114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        18,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/18/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:71a1bcace306ba70fbb9e107",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……你“也”？",
      "source_fingerprint": "cba893571daf12ae462009455a38a528ae072bf86212e1284876f29f4281f9f8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1084/storytimeline_501084114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        19,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/19/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80ea9cd395a70ef167f288c4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "谷野美酒",
      "source_fingerprint": "313e63f64ae1904fcf07bab0ada331d13e164e5dd9cfb8cdad386ace12e23d08",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1084/storytimeline_501084114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        19,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/19/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2c0c1f9b7234ab465dbc733c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "你也感觉到了吧？\n吉兆冷酷的灵魂波动。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f567fa103eed426debd9fe2d7e3eb4869d9ca2501b8f5904e2d1fd32e2de3cf",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1084/storytimeline_501084114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        19,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/19/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bbda7e70f58cd35536e56aa6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "今天我为了确认“某位赛马娘”的赛跑状况，\n因此前往模拟赛观战……",
      "source_fingerprint": "d4064b67dcea861820d0feef1731c107ca0c5f1a2f38ac707d9e3b6304d8d115",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1084/storytimeline_501084114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:38b214dd43d56af996484513",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "谷野美酒",
      "source_fingerprint": "313e63f64ae1904fcf07bab0ada331d13e164e5dd9cfb8cdad386ace12e23d08",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1084/storytimeline_501084114.json",
