    {
      "uid": "zhcn:14b60d29e7588505f3d80ecd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "一想像那射击线对准我的时候──\n呵呵，真是令人颤栗，也很愉悦……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d01d6ed2a63ed2cd499d6a757f3507031d8ca70a466bfaf8ded9bbd52d29431d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
