    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ffb182ef690167e732f0917",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "…………对了，\n必须向你坦白一件事。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f3e629cdbe99640804d6cc4cda5c5b4d104719ac0c1dda64492c4453bb4f6ceb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1084/storytimeline_501084114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        23,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/23/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cdf008c08ea2a7dbab9f50bd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "你的意思是──",
      "source_fingerprint": "f96974388fdb192c6a8a29043cc69d27cccd12abef634833d17019011bde5f97",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1084/storytimeline_501084114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        24,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/24/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a0c12f383515010d8da67a15",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "谷野美酒",
      "source_fingerprint": "313e63f64ae1904fcf07bab0ada331d13e164e5dd9cfb8cdad386ace12e23d08",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1084/storytimeline_501084114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        24,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/24/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e9055dc9d88d3a43cf14866",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她也是──\n让我感受到命运的人。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a580826301105747e8b9fcc2e3e3c0477cca7fa70befed3def2ced5562d500b2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1084/storytimeline_501084114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        24,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/24/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:58b1918f5cc093b9b3f2c7ba",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "被这句话唤起的回忆是\n谷野美酒曾经稍稍透露过的想法──",
      "source_fingerprint": "613bb8b8cfd210f0ffbcb463da13785b58ae492e9806bb120c911d8436d16642",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1084/storytimeline_501084114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        25,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/25/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f1a38031be86b2297ead1ec",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "也就是她坦承\n自己从伏特加身上感受到命运时的模样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "39e12841fc44c08df7756a790c865b934d8f2ac83b90d3c5c89a3e2e879c3fb4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1084/storytimeline_501084114.json",
      "json_path": [
