    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b39f8753f36d8663d787f4d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "从最前头到最后头都维持相同排名直到最后阶段。\n每位赛马娘都表现出对胜利的渴望──",
      "source_fingerprint": "2478de59eb40c86877b832817324a7f18502f78497311ab620b93adb3bb9d15a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1084/storytimeline_501084114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1fa3d5bcc47b0bbea3fcb81b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就这样，\n我与谷野美酒一同警戒吉兆──",
      "source_fingerprint": "279e49c2847dc45ae46053ba0a2a8026e9134acbd8bbb86dc30cb0c153eb1aab",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1084/storytimeline_501084114.json",
      "json_path": [
