      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "呵──\n你似乎有所渴望。\n这份贪婪真是罪孽深重……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "229fea0c079a413d75702d1d8451a9f0ddd744a2607d8bb4f390baeeffce66f6",
