      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "借此让这份调查纪录变得更加完善吧。\n就像编写禁忌之书那样……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e16d18a3683e40b41cbae19cfa7174ed37cedfd33894301cdf1a6490803e6b2b",
