      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在那之后，以谷野美酒的角度\n新增同期赛马娘的资讯，\n成功地提升了数据的精准度。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e795b891d692dbe2764854eeef8f563e69462182c3008b95dec6c65ecbf60196",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
